							"description": "Grammar of typeVersion 6: only \"#\" is a digit slot, a \"#\" preceded by a backslash is a literal, everything else is copied as is. The mask consumes the national significant number — nine digits in France — so it fits the numbers of one length only. A mask without any slot, or a typeVersion 5 mask left in its curly-brace form, fails the node at configuration time.",
